    <description>Minifleet record type cases are pushed in from Broker Portal via Rest API, which doesnt allow triggering notifications over api. So for this reason, custom solution is required where this flow comes in - this flow will ensure Minifleet Queries queue members are notified about new case as soon as its assigned to the queue.

Added on 7th July, 2025.
Flow was extended to send external notification as a confirmation to the quote submitter that it has been received.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
